{"type":"message","id":"79ab1bad","parentId":"604ac424","timestamp":"2026-03-14T06:41:44.855Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to create a new project called \"sumzy\" that:\n1. Uses the summarize skill to extract transcripts from Telegram links\n2. Analyzes videos and takes notes\n3. Builds documentation dashboards on GitHub\n4. Runs automatically via cron jobs every hour at minute 55\n5. Sends notifications when complete\n\nThis is a new project folder (third one after mimic and gaps). I need to:\n1. Create the sumzy directory structure\n2. Set up the necessary scripts for video analysis, transcript extraction, and dashboard building\n3. Configure cron jobs for automated execution\n4. Create GitHub Pages deployment workflows\n\nLet me start by creating the project folder and core files."},{"type":"text","text":"I'll create the **sumzy** project - your automated YouTube brief analyzer with transcript extraction, AI analysis, and GitHub Pages dashboards. Let me set this up:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"360359029","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p \"D:/AI_PROJECTS/projects/sumzy\"","workdir":"C:\\Users\\medo\\.openclaw\\workspace"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen3-5-9b","model":"qwen3.5-9b-claude-4.6-opus-reasoning-distilled","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773470392591}}
