{"type":"message","id":"e5ed0ed6","parentId":"3337fcdd","timestamp":"2026-03-14T06:42:53.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I'll create the project structure with all necessary files for the sumzy project."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"138656664","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Sumzy - Automated YouTube Brief Analyzer\n\n**Purpose**: Extract transcripts from YouTube links, analyze content with AI, generate flashcards, and build dashboards via GitHub Pages.\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nsumzy/\n├── cron/\n│   └── hourly-checker.ps1    # Runs every hour at minute 55\n├── telegram/\n│   └── link-catcher.py       # Detects links, queues for processing\n├── analyzer/\n│   ├── transcript-extractor.py\n│   ├── ai-analyzer.py        # Uses LM Studio API\n│   ├── flashcard-generator.py\n│   └── category-engine.py     # Badge assignment (📈 🏛️ ₿ etc.)\n├── frontend/\n│   ├── docs-dashboard/       # GitHub Pages site\n│   ├── build-script.ps1\n│   └── deploy.sh\n├── github/\n│   ├── repo-creator.py       # Auto-creates dashboard repos\n│   └── webhooks-handler.py    # Triggers builds on new briefs\n├── summarize/\n│   └── content-summarizer.py  # Summarize skill integration\n├── utils/\n│   ├── config.json           # API keys, paths\n│   └── cache/                # Processed transcripts (24h retention)\n└── main.py                   # Orchestrator\n```\n\n## Cron Job Schedule\n**Runs at**: Every hour at minute 55 (e.g., 9:55, 10:55, 11:55...)\n\n### Cron Entry:\n```powershell\ncron add -C \"D:\\AI_PROJECTS\\projects\\sumzy\\cron\\hourly-checker.ps1\" -S 55 * * * *\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Telegram Link Detection** → Captures YouTube links in messages\n2. **Queue Processing** → Extracts video ID, checks cache\n3. **Transcript Extraction** → Uses web_fetch/summarize skill\n4. **AI Analysis** → LM Studio generates insights + answers\n5. **Flashcard Generation** → SRS cards with categories\n6. **Dashboard Build** → Updates GitHub Pages site\n7. **Notification** → Sends \"Done - Check it out\" to Telegram\n\n## Output Files Created\n- `memory/2026-03-14.md` — Brief notes entry\n- `sumzy/cache/<video_id>.json` — Processed transcript + analysis\n- GitHub Pages site at your chosen repo\n","path":"D:/AI_PROJECTS/projects/sumzy/README.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen3-5-9b","model":"qwen3.5-9b-claude-4.6-opus-reasoning-distilled","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773470506323}}
